From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:43:17 +0000
Subject: fstep-settle: The host names a pause or a window change for the frame
 step, and keeps the GPU powered through a pause

mtl_fstep_settle reports a return to focus or a drawable size change; nvn_fstep
takes that frame as a stall and does not pay its lateness back. DM_NVN_PAUSE_WARM
(Mac): a 64-byte fill twice a second while nothing is presented, up to 2 minutes.
---
 dm/gfx/nvn/hle_nvn.c         |  2 ++
 dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_fstep.h       | 11 ++++++---
 dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m         | 45 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 dm/gfx/tests/t_fstep.c       | 13 +++++++++++
 docs/agents/symptoms.md      |  1 +
 docs/env_switches.tsv        |  2 ++
 docs/reference/frame-rate.md | 11 +++++++--
 7 files changed, 80 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

