@@ -52,6 +52,7 @@ DM_FSLOG	diagnostic	`=<file>` writes one TSV line per ReadFile: seconds since bo
 DM_FSLOG_HASH	diagnostic	With `DM_FSLOG`, adds a column with the FNV-1a 64 hash of the bytes read
 DM_FSTEP_PROBE_RAMP	switch	`0` ends a frame-step probe's grace after its 30 frames as before; by default the grace is renewed while the probe's frames keep getting cheaper (macOS raises the GPU clock for the shorter deadline over seconds); `ab` alternates with `DM_AB`
 DM_FULLSCREEN	player	`1` (any value but `0`) starts the Mac window in fullscreen; `0` or unset, a window. The Mac settings window's Display mode
+DM_FULLSCREEN_MENU_BAR	switch	`1` keeps macOS's behaviour in full screen on the Mac: the menu bar and title bar come back when the pointer is at the top of the screen; by default NXForge hides them and the Dock
